1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,400
What if we terraformed Mars?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,300
A crew lands in an empty crater.

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:14,300
Domes go up. Nobody goes outside without a suit.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,300
Factories pump greenhouse gas into the sky.

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:26,100
The ice melts. Water pools in the crater.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,300
First rain in 3 billion years.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,100
Moss, then grass. Rivers carve new valleys.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,300
Forests grow. The sky turns blue. The domes come down.

9
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:50,360
Plants have made enough air to breathe.

10
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,000
What would you build first?

